      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I watch the water\u0027s edge, recalling how I once hid from looters, the salty breeze reminding me of those times spent by the port. I let my focus go, where once I\u0027d watch for scraps on the street.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 16,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I mark the rock\u0027s edge, the salt-bright pool, and the anemones at the bottom. My intent is to examine closely, to stay alive here, to trust only the practical skill of this place.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 17,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I search the pool for food, not to stand and stare. Finds what keeps me, not what tastes nice.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 18,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I won\u0027t delve into the tide pool\u0027s secrets. That would be foolish, and I\u0027ll think on it again. I could seize a crab here. I\u0027ll use the street\u0027s harsh conditions to stay alive, marking the safe alleyways.",
